flowchart LR
  subgraph API[FastAPI / API Layer]
    R[Routes] --> CS[CommandService]
    H[Health endpoints] --> RG[ReadinessGate]
  end

  subgraph APP[Application Layer]
    CS -->|validate + policy + idempotency| Q[(Command Queue)]
  end

  subgraph EXEC[Robot Execution Layer]
    Q --> A[RobotActor (single owner)]
    A -->|run_in_threadpool| SDK[XArmAPI SDK]
    CB[SDK callbacks] --> SS[StateStore]
    A --> SS
  end

  RG --> SS
